WEBVTT

00:41:28.262 --> 00:41:30.142
We rally around our kids.

00:41:30.166 --> 00:41:33.767
So if we had a set of policies to help
kids have early childhood education

00:41:33.791 --> 00:41:37.245
and nurse-family partnerships
and better schooling and better training,

00:41:37.269 --> 00:41:39.078
that's something we can all agree on.

00:41:39.102 --> 00:41:40.739
Second, we rally around our work,

00:41:40.763 --> 00:41:43.100
our ability to give
to each other through work.

00:41:43.124 --> 00:41:45.818
And if we had a set of policies
that were about training,

00:41:45.842 --> 00:41:48.225
about community colleges,
about wage subsidies,

00:41:48.249 --> 00:41:50.319
that would lend dignity to work.

00:41:50.343 --> 00:41:52.412
That's something else
we could rally around.

00:41:52.436 --> 00:41:54.396
Third, we rally around a story.

00:41:54.420 --> 00:41:57.206
A community is a group of people
who share a single story,

00:41:57.230 --> 00:42:00.158
and we as Americans have lost our story.